  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a rank three water prison Gu. Wang Han says he took a high interest loan and bought it on purpose to deal with Fang Yuan and claim All-out Effort Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          288
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_all_out_effort_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited chapter shows the worm’s body shape in an aperture. He opens his mouth and spits a blue ball of water that expands and encloses the target.",
        "chapters": [
          288
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Once trapped, the water ball holds firm against hard strikes. Fang Yuan’s boar strength phantom shakes and deforms it without collapse. His bear strength phantom almost breaks it, but the ball returns to shape. Wang Han claims beast strength is hard while the flow of water is soft, so softness subdues hardness.",
        "chapters": [
          288
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan then kicks with crocodile strength phantom. Unlike boar and brown bear, crocodile strength is amphibious and adept at the water element, and that kick smashes the water prison to pieces.",
        "chapters": [
          288
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "That kick’s impact carries him forward to kill Wang Han and end the battle.",
        "chapters": [
          289
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Wang Han brings it out only after he decides he cannot win a prolonged fight against All-out Effort Gu phantoms. He treats the prison as the tool that lets him finish Fang Yuan and seize All-out Effort Gu under battle stage rules. The prison buys him a short pause and a boast, then fails when crocodile strength lands.",
        "chapters": [
          288
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-on-the-battle-stage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The match ends with Wang Han dead on the stage; the hosting Gu Master declares Fang Yuan the winner.",
        "chapters": [
          289
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-on-the-battle-stage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
